    "dag": "Four compatible speed-1 workers; quota4, account capacities slots4/budget40; manual v2 unrestricted units with explicit cpu tool; rolesParallel omitted => true for event_driven. Authors A2/B5 start together, latest5; R3 ends8; validation1 commits9. C waits P commit, repeats9 => commits18. Nominal total work=2*(2+5+3)=20, excluding validation. Useful scheduled work and occupation=20. Critical path=2*(max(2,5)+3+1)=18. lowerBound=max(18,20/4)=18.",
