    "hard": "Adopt A@1, HARD new_scc A@2, stop-confirm A@3 retry=true. Two A author jobs occupy0..3:6ticks; HARD prevents new generation. B held until3 then authors finish7/10,R10..12,validate12..13. B commit13; occupation6+13=19, useful13,rework6,reworkAttempts0. Stuck makespan NOT asserted as13; only publicationEnd13.",
    "adoption": "Adopt A@1 without HARD: current eligible A finishes at10, peer B starts10 and commits20. Occupation26,useful26,rework0,one attempt each. Later reserve A refused due immutable-plan adoption obligation, no history rewritten.",
    "cancelRetry": "Cancel A@2, stop A@3 retry=true, no replan requirement. Old A occupancy6. B was FIFO waiter since0, starts3, commits13. A retry waits key then starts13, commits23. Occupation6+13+13=32,useful26,rework6,reworkAttempts1; A attempts2/B1; no release on cancel alone."
